</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord Jesus, mighty Savior,</l><l>I trust in Thy great name;</l><l>I look for Thy salvation,</l><l>Thy promise now I claim.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now, Lord, I yield my members,</l><l>From sin’s dominion free,</l><l>For warfare and for triumph,</l><l>As weapons unto Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, blissful self-surrender,</l><l>To live, my Lord, by Thee;</l><l>Now, Son of God, my Savior,</l><l>Live out Thy life in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
